# Everything a bake or an import computed. `assetlib_cli migrate` reads each .bimport's `outputs`
# and writes back whatever is not on disk, byte for byte, so none of it is work.
# See bernini/docs/asset_containers.md.
/Data/Derived/*

# ...except the environment family. Its bake reads a .hdr, no project copies its .hdr in, and the
# producing walk reads only .bimport documents -- so nothing puts an absent one back. These lines go
# the day an env source lives in the project beside the meshes'.
!/Data/Derived/Sky/
!/Data/Derived/EnvLighting/

# macOS Finder droppings.
.DS_Store
